  Dependencies listed in package.json retain the licenses distributed by
  their respective authors. Their license texts and notices control where
  they differ from this file.

* @mlc-ai/web-llm:
  Distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. On-device model weights
  are obtained separately and may be subject to an upstream model license,
  including the Llama Community License, Qwen License, or Microsoft Research
  License. Review the license for each selected model before redistribution
  or commercial use.

* OpenStreetMap data and tiles:
  Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors and is available under the Open
  Database License (ODbL) 1.0. See:
  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
  Tile access must also comply with the OpenStreetMap Foundation Tile Usage
  Policy.

* Nominatim:
  Geocoding data is subject to the ODbL and requests must comply with the
  Nominatim Usage Policy:
  https://operations.osmfoundation.org/policies/nominatim/

* Open-Meteo:
  Weather data is provided under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
  International license (CC BY 4.0), subject to the provider's terms.

* Wikipedia and Wikimedia:
  Content may be available under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike
  4.0 International license (CC BY-SA 4.0) or another notice attached to the
  specific work. Check the source page before reuse.

* OpenRouteService, OpenTripMap, Groq, Supabase, and MyMemory:
  These hosted APIs and services are used under their respective terms of
